claimed: okay-script-image -- the third of the operator's four (2026-09-07): 'the page is the deployment', packaged. A ScriptDeploy value (okay-deploy) for okay-script rendering okay-script/deploy (Dockerfile, compose.yaml, helm), running okay.script.Serve over a pages directory copied into the image; okayScript gains OkayDeploy.deployable("okay.script.Serve") and okayDeploy as a main dependency. Serve gains the env fallback the image needs: with NO arguments it reads OKAY_PAGES and OKAY_PORT (the entrypoint is `java -jar app.jar`, no args), keeping the usage refusal when neither is set. Drift test like TestDemoDeploy. Touches build.sbt, Serve.scala, a new ScriptDeploy.scala, okay-script/deploy/*, specs/okay-script.md, docs.
